---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Commercial Burglar Alarm Installation Kansas City | USS" description="Protect your Kansas City business with commercial burglar alarm installation from USS. Fast intrusion detection &amp; 24/7 monitoring. Call 816-787-2061 today!">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center; padding:7rem 2rem 3rem;">
        <h1>Commercial Burglar Alarm Installation in Kansas City</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:1.1rem; max-width:760px; margin:1rem auto 0;">Protect your inventory, assets, and staff with robust, commercial-grade intrusion detection and 24/7 monitored alarm systems tailored for Kansas City small businesses.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:2rem; display:flex; gap:1rem; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ordering-system">Get a Quote / Order</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="tel:8167872061">Call 816-787-2061</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">Comprehensive Intrusion Detection &amp; Commercial Alarm Systems</h2>
            <p class="anim" style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:820px;">Every small business faces unique physical security challenges, from storefront smash-and-grabs to unauthorized warehouse access. Ultimate Security Solutions LLC designs and deploys fully tailored commercial burglar alarm systems engineered to stop unauthorized entry before it turns into severe loss. We outfit your facility with commercial-grade control panels, perimeter door and window contacts, glass-break sensors, wide-angle dual-technology motion detectors, and outdoor-rated siren strobes.

Our systems integrate seamlessly with cellular LTE backup communicators to ensure reliable 24/7 central station monitoring even if on-site power or internet lines are cut. Whether you operate a retail boutique in Overland Park, an auto shop in Independence, or a medical clinic in downtown Kansas City, we deliver high-reliability alarm infrastructure that keeps you compliant with local building codes and commercial property insurance requirements.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">Why Kansas City Small Businesses Trust Ultimate Security Solutions</h2>
            <p class="anim" style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:820px;">Unlike national aggregators that lock business owners into bloated multi-year subscriptions with proprietary hardware, USS delivers flexible, non-proprietary security installations backed by local expertise. As a veteran-owned, fully insured ($1M General Liability) low-voltage integrator based in Independence, MO, we provide direct technician-to-owner accountability on every deployment without middlemen or subcontracted runarounds.

We bring clean structured cabling, expert device calibration, and unified integration capabilities across commercial IP camera networks, cloud-managed access control, and wireless infrastructure. When you work with USS, you get ruggedized hardware, zero unnecessary service fees, and local support directly from technician Nate Follis.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">Our Simple Installation Process &amp; Transparent Pricing Guidance</h2>
            <p class="anim" style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:820px;">Getting your business protected is straightforward and hassle-free. We start with a comprehensive on-site or blueprint security assessment of your facility to map high-risk perimeter zones, entryways, and sensitive storage rooms. Within 24 hours, you receive a transparent, fixed-scope proposal detailing equipment counts, monitoring options, and professional labor.

Most small business alarm installations range between $800 and $3,500 depending on total square footage, hardwired vs. hybrid wireless sensor architecture, and optional integration with access control or CCTV cameras. All installations include full system walk-throughs, mobile app configuration for multi-user management, and dedicated post-install warranty support.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section section-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">PRICING — STARTING POINTS</h2>
            <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">IP Camera System Installation</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $1200 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ system (4-8 cameras)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Access Control System</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $1800 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ door (reader + electric strike)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Low-Voltage Network Cabling</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $150 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ drop (Cat6, terminated &amp; tested)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Burglar Alarm System</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $950 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ system</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Structured Cabling / MDF-IDF Buildout</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $2500 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ closet</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Business Wi-Fi Deployment</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $1400 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ AP (incl. survey)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Site Survey / Security Consulting</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $500 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ visit</span></p>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">FAQ</h2>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Can I manage our commercial alarm system from my smartphone?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Yes. Our commercial alarm installations feature intuitive mobile and web app access, allowing business owners and managers to arm, disarm, review entry logs, and receive instant intrusion push notifications from anywhere.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Does my Kansas City business need hardwired or wireless intrusion detection?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Hardwired sensors are recommended for drop-ceiling commercial spaces and newly constructed buildings due to maximum long-term reliability. However, we also deploy encrypted commercial wireless sensors for finished retail or historic spaces where running structured wire is impractical.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Can your burglar alarm system integrate with security cameras and card access?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Yes. USS specializes in complete low-voltage integration. We can tie your alarm system directly into commercial IP security cameras and access control readers for coordinated event triggers, automated lockdown, and synchronized video playback.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">How fast can USS complete an alarm installation in the Kansas City metro?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Most small-to-midsize commercial facilities are fully surveyed, cabled, mounted, and tested within 1 to 2 business days following proposal approval, minimizing any downtime for your operations.</p>
        </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.85rem;">Ultimate Security Solutions LLC — Kansas City, MO · Licensed · Bonded · $1M Insured</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</Page>
